\description{
Tools can return ordinary R values for text conversion, or \code{\link[=tool_result]{tool_result()}}
for explicit MCP content and structured data. This topic defines the shared
serialization contract. See \code{\link[=tool_result]{tool_result()}} for construction and fallback,
